@startuml post-verify-code
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title POST /api/v1/user/student/verify/code
caption CRB-31 · 인증코드 확인. 성공 시 student.email · verified_at 기록, 5회 틀리면 무효

actor Client
participant "SignupStepGuard\nUserTypeGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "StudentController" as Controller
participant "StudentVerificationService" as Service
participant "StudentRepository" as StudentRepository
participant "StudentEmailVerificationRepository" as VerificationRepository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: POST /api/v1/user/student/verify/code\nAuthorization: Bearer <access token>\n{ code }
ref over Client, Guard
  SignupStepGuard → UserTypeGuard — flow/auth-guards.puml
  @SignupStep({ step: "verify" }) — pending 이고 next_step = verify 일 때만 (active 불가)
  @UserTypes("student")
  401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / User not found
  403 Signup is already completed / Signup step mismatch / User type not allowed
end ref
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt body 검증 실패 (code 누락 · 숫자 6자리 아님)
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
Pipe -> Controller: verifyCode(req, user)
Controller -> Service: verifyCode(userPk, code)

group transaction (DatabaseService.db.transaction)
  Service -> StudentRepository: findByUserPkForUpdate(userPk, tx)
  StudentRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT student WHERE user_pk = ? FOR UPDATE
  note right: 동시에 여러 번 확인해도\n시도 횟수가 정확히 쌓이도록 직렬화
  PostgreSQL --> StudentRepository: row
  StudentRepository --> Service: student

  Service -> VerificationRepository: findByStudentPk(studentPk, tx)
  VerificationRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT student_email_verification WHERE student_pk = ?
  PostgreSQL --> VerificationRepository: row
  VerificationRepository --> Service: verification | null

  alt 요청 없음 또는 attempt_count >= 5
    note over Service: 결과 = NOT_FOUND
  else expires_at <= now
    note over Service: 결과 = EXPIRED\n(행은 만료 인증번호 정리 스케줄러가 지움, CRB-29)
  else 코드 불일치 (timingSafeEqual)
    Service -> VerificationRepository: incrementAttemptCount(studentPk, tx)
    VerificationRepository -> PostgreSQL: UPDATE student_email_verification\nSET attempt_count = attempt_count + 1 RETURNING attempt_count
    note right
      5번째 실패여도 행은 지우지 않음
      → 이후 확인은 404, 재전송 60초 대기도 유지
    end note
    note over Service: 결과 = WRONG, remaining = 5 - attempt_count
  else 코드 일치
    Service -> StudentRepository: markVerified(studentPk, email, tx)
    StudentRepository -> PostgreSQL: UPDATE student SET email = ?, verified_at = now(), updated_at = now()
    alt student.email UNIQUE 위반 (23505: 다른 계정이 같은 이메일을 방금 인증)
      PostgreSQL -[#red]-> Service: DrizzleQueryError (cause.code = 23505)
      note right of Service: 트랜잭션 rollback 후\nisUniqueViolation(e)로 판별
      Service -[#red]-> Client: 409 Email already verified by another account
    end
    Service -> VerificationRepository: deleteByStudentPk(studentPk, tx)
    VerificationRepository -> PostgreSQL: DELETE student_email_verification WHERE student_pk = ?
    note over Service: 결과 = OK
  end
end
note over Service, PostgreSQL
  틀린 횟수가 커밋되도록 트랜잭션 안에서는 결과만 정하고
  404 · 410 · 400 예외는 커밋 뒤에 던짐
end note

alt NOT_FOUND
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 404 No verification in progress
else EXPIRED
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 410 Verification code expired
else WRONG
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 400 Invalid verification code\n{ statusCode, message, remaining_attempts }
  note right of Service
    AllExceptionsFilter가 HttpException 응답 객체의
    추가 필드(remaining_attempts)를 같이 내보냄
  end note
end

Service --> Controller: BaseResultDto.OK
Controller --> Client: 201 { result: "OK" }
note right of Client: 다음 단계는 next_step = profile\n(GET /api/v1/user/info 로 확인)

@enduml
